00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:25.666 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce qui inquiète le pédiatre,

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:27.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est que les enfants libanais

00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:29.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
n'ont plus l'immuné é pour

00:01:25.766 --> 00:01:30.766 size:53% position:73% line:53%
