00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
parce que les gens... d'abord,

00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:49.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il n'y a plus beaucoup de

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:50.666 size:53% position:73% line:53%
