00:01:52.266 --> 00:01:56.366 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vaccination de nos enfants.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.899 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Là, on est  l la 140e place.

00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:59.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(pleurs d'un enfant)

00:01:56.466 --> 00:02:00.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En Haïti, on est encore

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.466 size:53% position:73% line:53%
