00:02:33.233 --> 00:02:37.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Dans la région de Port-au-

00:02:34.733 --> 00:02:39.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Prince, les violences forcent

00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:40.766 size:53% position:73% line:53%
